---
import { sitePath } from "../scripts/site-path.js";
import { SITE_NAME } from "../site.js";
import InformationLayout from "../layouts/InformationLayout.astro";
---

<InformationLayout title="About" description="Useful everyday tools, with a little less friction.">
  <section>
    <h2>Small tasks should feel simple</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAME} brings practical utilities together in one place. Resize an image, prepare a PDF, set a countdown, or browse a folder of photos and videos without installing a separate app.</p>
    <p>The aim is a calm workspace: clear controls, readable previews, and room to focus on what you came to do.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>What you can do here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={sitePath("/image-tools/")}>Image Tools</a> — resize, compress, convert, and inspect image metadata.</li>
      <li><a href={sitePath("/image-to-pdf/")}>Image to PDF</a> — arrange images and turn them into a PDF.</li>
      <li><a href={sitePath("/merge-pdf/")}>Merge PDF</a> — select, reorder, and combine pages from PDFs.</li>
      <li><a href={sitePath("/pdf-viewer/")}>PDF Viewer</a> — read PDFs, highlight text, and brush over scanned content.</li>
      <li><a href={sitePath("/countdown-timer/")}>Countdown Timer</a> — keep track of time with a clear fullscreen display.</li>
      <li><a href={sitePath("/media-viewer/")}>Photo &amp; Video Viewer</a> — browse local media, zoom into photos, and play slideshows.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Your files stay with you</h2>
    <p>The current file tools process selected files in your browser. File contents are not sent to our servers for conversion, previews, or metadata reading. The media viewer reads only files or folders you choose.</p>
    <p>You can use the tools without creating an account. Read the <a href={sitePath("/privacy/")}>Privacy Policy</a> for details about local storage and website requests.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Built for everyday use</h2>
    <p>The tools are free to use and support light and dark themes. Available formats, playback, and performance depend on your browser and device. Keep a copy of your originals and check exported files before relying on them.</p>
  </section>
</InformationLayout>
